  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hi, how are you holding up?",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 0.66,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_16"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "A bit tired today, but okay.",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 0.45,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Weird question, but my hands get really sweaty and I hate shaking hands at interviews.",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 0.4,
   "block": "job_interview.dlg7",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Not weird at all, it's really common. A few small things help a lot.",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 0.84,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg7"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Like what?",
   "est_sec": 0.72,
   "gap_before": 0.73,
   "block": "job_interview.dlg7",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Run your hands under cold water just before you go in, and keep a tissue in your pocket to dab them in reception.",
   "est_sec": 7.23,
   "gap_before": 1.09,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg7"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Hey Grayson, which drawer do the bin bags live in now?",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 0.75,
   "block": "nq_home_008",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "other_name",
   "phrasing": "nq_home_008",
   "name_pos": "start",
   "addressee": "Grayson"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "other",
   "text": "Under the sink, left side.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.36,
   "block": "nq_home_008"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "And if they're still damp?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 1.11,
   "block": "job_interview.dlg7",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "A firm, quick handshake and a smile. Most people won't notice, and nobody will remember it after the first minute.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 1.15,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg7"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Right. I always think",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.37,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg7"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "it's the only thing they'll remember about me.",
